{"id":"nad","lemma":"над","pos":"prep","rank":207,"glosses":["above, over"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/54/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-Cinemantique-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B4.wav/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-Cinemantique-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B4.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Кто живёт над вами?","en":"Who lives above you?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"},null,{"g":"you","l":"вы"}]},{"text":"Я думаю над этим.","en":"I'm thinking it over.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},null,null]},{"text":"Дай мне немного подумать над этим.","en":"Let me think it over a bit.","words":[{"g":"the more insistent form…"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"a little, some"},{"g":"to think"},null,null]},{"text":"Я работаю над этим весь день.","en":"I've been working on this all day.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to work","l":"работать"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"all day"]]},{"text":"Том сейчас над этим работает.","en":"Tom is working on that now.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"now"},null,null,{"g":"to work","l":"работать"}]}]}